WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.423
Lab 2 moves to your own test
tenant, worldwide or G C C,

2
00:00:04.423 --> 00:00:10.150
with Entra I D P one or P two, never
production, with fictional people.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:14.762
You also need Chapter 1's test
host and Chapter 2's Lab 2 inputs.

4
00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:18.961
Register a reader app with a certificate
and the four read permissions,

5
00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:21.025
run a baseline, and have it approved.

6
00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:25.687
Then make three changes by hand:
two secrets and one consent grant.

7
00:00:25.687 --> 00:00:29.526
Run the drift run, and check the
activity names it found against the

8
00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:33.225
admin center's audit log, because
that's what the fixture assumed.

9
00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:36.000
Then package and verify the test runs.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.100
To back it out, step seven removes
both secrets and the consent grant,

11
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.028
the four permissions and
the Reader assignment,

12
00:00:43.028 --> 00:00:47.713
deletes the reader app and its certificate,
and deletes the runs and packages.

13
00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:49.920
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
